    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the bleed isolation valve installation at the two engine positions, the cross-bleed position and the ground connection, with the ducts, regulators and attachment hardware.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "To identify the parts of the bleed isolation valve installation at all four valve positions.",
